<subpara id="RM000000602011X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___00004IU00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (Excluding Momentary Interruption Items)</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and connect the SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and check the ECU data following the screen display of the SST (TaSCAN).</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Computer data values vary greatly due to slight measurement errors, differences in measurement environment, changes in the vehicle over time, etc., making it difficult to specify clear standard (judgment) values. Therefore, a malfunction may exist even if values are within the reference range.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</step2>
</step1>
