<step1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (Momentary Interruption Items)</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), momentary interruptions (open circuits) in the connectors and wire harnesses between the skid control computer (built into actuator assembly) ←→ each sensor or between the skid control computer (built into actuator assembly) ←→ engine control computer can be detected with the ECU data monitor.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and connect the SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON, display the ECU data monitor following the screen display of the SST (TaSCAN), and select the item for the area to be monitored for momentary interruption.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Momentary interruptions (open circuits) cannot be detected for 3 seconds after the IG is turned ON (during the initial check).</ptxt>
</atten4>
